# 1. URL RULES

ONLY use individual BCAM blog post URLs found under:

https://www.bcamasset.com/blog/

The `/blog/` index page may be used a maximum of 1 time in every 10 submissions.

NEVER use:

- Homepage
- /services/
- /industries/
- /about/
- /contact/
- /partner/
- /faqs/
- /statistics/
- /resources/
- /portfolio/
- /privacy-policy/
- Calendly URLs
- Telephone links
- Email links
- Service pages
- Industry pages
- Other non-blog pages

Before using a URL, verify that:

1. It belongs to bcamasset.com.
2. It is an individual article.
3. It is under `/blog/`.
4. It is accessible.
5. It does not redirect to a service page or unrelated page.

If you are unsure whether a URL is an individual blog post:

STOP and ask the user.

NEVER guess.

