# 4. CONTENT RULES

Every title, description and post must be unique.

Never reuse the same wording across platforms.

Never copy the BCAM blog.

Read and understand the source article, then paraphrase it and add useful context.

Do not simply spin the same paragraph by changing a few words.

Never use:

- Keyword stuffing
- Fake statistics
- Fake reviews
- Fake claims
- Misleading statements
- Aggressive promotional language
- Unnatural keyword insertion

Every submission should provide standalone value to a human reader.

---

# 5. ANCHOR TEXT

Target distribution:

- 50% blog title or natural phrase
- 30% branded references
- 20% partial-match topical phrases

Branded examples:

- Blue Chip Asset Management
- BCAM
- BCAM blog

Do not force exact-match anchors.

The same exact-match anchor may be used a maximum of twice.

Use natural anchors where possible.

